From: Eryk Wieliczko <eryk@wieliczko.ninja>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:05:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] docs: gpu: describe M4 graphics ownership and qualification
 limits

Document the native M4 interfaces, per-VM memory cost and resource
lifetime, bounded submission backpressure, and the abort, suspend and kexec
limits. State the unqualified firmware telemetry freshness and display
power-policy gaps explicitly. Host tests, native functional tests and a
complete conformance submission are distinct evidence.

